man-adrian-hill-conduct-players", "teams": ["ARI", "MIN"], "text": "NFL suspends officials Jeff Seeman, Adrian Hill for conduct toward players. The NFL has suspended line judge Jeff Seeman for two games for appearing to swear at Cardinals tight end Trey McBride. Referee Adrian Hill has been suspended one game for a separate incident in the Viking", "status": "suspended", "confirmed": true}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T21:53:24.038Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/a729adacbe9dd", "teams": ["ARI"], "text": "A big loss: Cardinals HC Mike LaFleur said LT Paris Johnson Jr. tore his bicep and now will be out for the season.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Sarah Barshop", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T21:50:28Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50112291/mcvay-rams-coaches-learn-incident-eagles-fans", "teams": ["LA", "PHI"], "text": "McVay: Rams coaches will 'learn' from incident with Eagles fans. Rams coach Sean McVay says his assistant coaches will learn from their viral interaction with Eagles fans during Sunday's win over Philadelphia.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Tim McManus", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T21:46:38Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50111928/sources-eagles-rb-tank-bigsby-surgery-headed-ir", "teams": ["PHI"], "text": "Sources: Eagles RB Tank Bigsby to have surgery, headed to IR. Eagles running back Tank Bigsby sustained a core muscle injury Sunday that requires surgery, sources told NFL Network's Ian Rapoport.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Nick Wagoner", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T21:39:19Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50111202/sources-49ers-pro-bowl-fb-juszczyk-knee-expected-2-3-weeks", "teams": ["SF"], "text": "Sources: 49ers Pro Bowl FB Juszczyk (knee) expected out 2-3 weeks. 49ers Pro Bowl fullback Kyle Juszczyk suffered a knee sprain and bone bruise that is expected to sideline him for two to three weeks, sources told ESPN's Adam Schefter and NFL Network's Ian Rapoport.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Nick Suss", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T21:34:58Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50111808/bills-cb-maxwell-hairston-sorry-skipping-media-addresses-struggles", "teams": ["BUF"], "text": "Bills CB Maxwell Hairston sorry for skipping media, addresses struggles. A day after skipping out on the media, Bills cornerback Maxwell Hairston held an impromptu news conference to apologize and provide context for his early-season struggles.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Courtney Cronin", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T21:30:49Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50110486/ben-johnson-tyson-bagent-start-qb-bears-vs-packers", "teams": ["CHI", "GB"], "text": "Ben Johnson: Tyson Bagent will start at QB for Bears vs. Packers. Tyson Bagent will be the Bears' starting quarterback for Sunday's game at the Packers, coach Ben Johnson announced Monday.", "status": "will start", "confirmed": true}, {"author": "Rob Demovsky", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T21:25:23Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50110763/sources-packers-lb-edgerrin-cooper-torn-achilles", "teams": ["GB"], "text": "Packers LB Edgerrin Cooper has season-ending torn Achilles. Packers linebacker Edgerrin Cooper suffered a season-ending Achilles tear during Sunday's 17-14 victory over the Buccaneers.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Nate Taylor", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T21:24:35Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50111568/sources-chiefs-wr-tyquan-thornton-expected-back-12-16-weeks", "teams": ["KC"], "text": "Sources: Chiefs WR Tyquan Thornton expected back in 12-16 weeks. Chiefs wide receiver Tyquan Thornton is expected back from a dislocated left ankle injury within 12 to 16 weeks, sources told NFL Network.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "ESPN", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T21:08:12Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50110871/broncos-get-good-news-pat-surtain-ii-ankle-sources-say", "teams": ["DEN"], "text": "Broncos get good news on Pat Surtain II's ankle, sources say. Broncos star cornerback Pat Surtain II avoided a worst-case scenario on his ankle injury, sources told NFL Network's Ian Rapoport.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Jeff Legwold", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T21:06:16Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50110612/pat-surtain-ii-injury-denver-broncos-defense-effects", "teams": ["DEN"], "text": "Pat Surtain II out with an ankle injury: How will the Denver Broncos adjust?. While Surtain was able to avoid a long-term, season-ending injury, the loss of him and Riley Moss puts the Broncos in a short-term bind.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Ben Baby", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T21:04:24Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50111779/bengals-wr-tee-higgins-day-day-adductor-injury-coach-says", "teams": ["CIN"], "text": "Bengals WR Tee Higgins day-to-day with adductor injury, coach says. Bengals wide receiver Tee Higgins is considered day-to-day with an adductor issue he suffered toward the end of Sunday's 22-17 loss to the Jacksonville Jaguars.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "ESPN", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T20:41:32Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50109680/tyreek-hill-expected-sign-team-soon-agent-says", "teams": ["KC"], "text": "Tyreek Hill could sign with new team soon, agent says. Free agent wide receiver Tyreek Hill could sign with a new team \"over the next few days,\" his agent, Drew Rosenhaus, told ESPN's Adam Schefter. Hill's former team, the Chiefs, are believed to be one of those interested.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Kevin Seifert", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T20:39:10Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50111468/vikings-lg-jackson-likely-season-lt-darrisaw-concussion", "teams": ["MIN"], "text": "Vikings LG Jackson likely out for season, LT Darrisaw has concussion. Vikings left guard Donovan Jackson is headed for what is likely season-ending surgery to repair a meniscus tear, and left tackle Christian Darrisaw is in the concussion protocol.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Jamison Hensley", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T20:26:25Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50111347/ravens-unsure-lamar-jackson-ankle-play-vs-falcons", "teams": ["BAL"], "text": "Ravens unsure if Lamar Jackson (ankle) will play vs. Falcons. The Ravens are uncertain whether quarterback Lamar Jackson will play Sunday night against the Falcons.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "ESPN", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T20:08:35Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/video/clip/_/id/50109768/chris-canty-shares-frustration-how-much-blame-joe-burrow-deserves", "teams": ["CIN"], "text": "Chris Canty shares frustration with how much blame Joe Burrow deserves. Chris Canty shares frustration with how much blame Joe Burrow deserves", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Nate Taylor", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T20:08:17Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50110299/tyreek-hill-chiefs-reunion-help", "teams": ["KC"], "text": "Why a Tyreek Hill-Chiefs reunion makes so much sense. The Chiefs had been monitoring and receiving updates on Hill's rehab and training sessions, even before the injuries to Tyquan Thornton and Rashee Rice.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "ESPN", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-10-05T20:05:15Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/video/clip/_/id/50111484/officials-involved-week-4-controversies-receiving-suspensions", "teams": [], "text": "Schefter: Officials involved in Week 4 controversies receiving suspensions. Schefter: Of